<title>USA: USABancShares ends merger agreement.</title>
<headline>USABancShares ends merger agreement.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USABancShares said on Monday that the merger agreement with Keystone Savings and Loan, of Malvern, Pa., has been terminated by both companies.</p>
<p>Further details about the termination were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
